#. …苗木君、聞き込みの成果はどうだった？
msgctxt "0001 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So Makoto, how's your investigation going?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは霧切さんに、
#. 腐川さんと葉隠クンの証言を伝えた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I told Kyoko what Toko and Hiro had told me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. なるほどね…十神クンも含めた３人全員が、
#. 大神さんに会いに行ってないと言ってるのね。
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I see... So along with Byakuya, they're both claiming\n"
"they didn't go see her."
msgstr ""

#. だけど…怪しいわね…
#. 誰かが<CLT 3>ウソをついている<CLT>のかも…
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But it's all too convenient. Someone must be\n"
"<CLT 3>lying<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>誰かが…ウソを…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Someone's...lying...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それはそうと、こっちの方でも進展があったわよ。
msgctxt "0006 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Well, I've made some progress of my own."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>大神さんの死体<CLT>…<CLT 3>雑誌が収納されている棚<CLT>…
#. それと<CLT 3>モノクマボトル<CLT>…
msgctxt "0007 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 3>Sakura's body<CLT>, the <CLT 3>shelf of magazines<CLT>, and the\n"
"<CLT 3>Monokuma Bottles<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. そこに新しい手掛かりがあったわよ。
#. もう１度、よく調べてみるといいわ。
msgctxt "0008 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"These three things have revealed new clues. You'd do\n"
"well to look them over one more time."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>大神さんの死体<CLT>…<CLT 3>雑誌が収納されている棚<CLT>…
#. それと<CLT 3>モノクマボトル<CLT>…
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 3>Sakura's body<CLT>, the <CLT 3>shelf of magazines<CLT>, and the\n"
"<CLT 3>Monokuma Bottles<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. そこに新しい手掛かりがあったわよ。
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"These three things have revealed new clues. You'd do\n"
"well to look them over one more time."
msgstr ""

#. さっきの<CLT 3>実験の結果<CLT>と<CLT 3>モノクマボトルの規則性<CLT>…
#. それらを併せて考えてみれば…
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The <CLT 3>results of our experiment<CLT>, and the <CLT 3>correlation\n"
"between each of the bottles<CLT>—put it all together..."
msgstr ""

#. そこから導き出される答えは１つしかないように、
#. 私には思えるけど…
msgctxt "0012 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"...and I believe you will arrive at one very\n"
"persuasive conclusion."
msgstr ""

#. あなたはどう考える？　あなた次第よ…
msgctxt "0013 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So? What do you think? It's all on you..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>床の破片の方が、割れていないモノクマボトルよりも
#. 重かったという実験の結果…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The experiment showed that the pieces of glass on the\n"
"floor were heavier than an intact Monokuma Bottle.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それと、モノクマボトルの規則性…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And the bottles all have something in common...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここに重要な秘密が隠されているのは、
#. 確かなはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's apparently an important secret hidden there.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人なんて…最初から決まってんじゃん…
msgctxt "0017 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "We already know who did it...!"
msgstr ""

#. 十神、腐川、葉隠の誰かなんだよ！
msgctxt "0018 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Byakuya, Toko, or Hiro—it had to be one of them!"
msgstr ""

#. あの３人は、さくらちゃんに呼び出されてたんだよ。
#. しかも、この娯楽室にね…
msgctxt "0019 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"You see, Sakura asked all three of them to meet with\n"
"her. You know where? Right here in the rec room."
msgstr ""

#. 犯人は腐川に決まりだね！
msgctxt "0020 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Toko's the killer, I'm sure of it!"
msgstr ""

#. あの雑誌が決定的な証拠！
#. これで犯人を追いつめられるよ！！
msgctxt "0021 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"That magazine proves it! We've got the killer\n"
"cornered!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このドアが、娯楽室の<CLT><CLT 3>唯一の出入り口<CLT><CLT 4>なんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This door is the <CLT><CLT 3>only way<CLT><CLT 4> in or out of the rec\n"
"room...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このドアには鍵もないし、
#. ドアの金具を取り外したような形跡もない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The door doesn't have a lock, and there's no evidence\n"
"that the mountings have been tampered with.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>唯一、変わっている点は、
#. 窓が割れている事だけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The only notable change to the door is...the smashed\n"
"window.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それは、さっき部屋に入る時に
#. ボクが割ったせいだったな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which happened, of course, when I broke it to get\n"
"inside...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>他にも、糸とかそういう何かで仕掛けを施した形跡は、
#. 全く見られない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no evidence that any kind of string or\n"
"mechanism was used on the door...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In other words...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Nói cách khác...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. ドア自体には、
#. どこにも不審な点はないって事だな。
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"...I don't see anything suspicious about the door\n"
"itself."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>雑誌が収納されている棚にも、
#. 新しい手掛かりがあるって言ってたっけ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko said the magazine shelf was hiding a clue of\n"
"some kind...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. えーっと、手掛かりらしきものは…
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hmm...clue...clue..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…あれ？　１冊だけ、
#. 上下が逆さまになってる雑誌があるな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...Huh? This magazine is upside down.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>誰かが、戻す時に間違えたのかな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Did someone put it back that way on accident?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …気になる物があるなら、
#. 詳しく調べてみた方がいいわよ？
msgctxt "0033 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If something catches your eye, it's important for you\n"
"to explore that in detail, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

#. うん、そうだね…
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, you're right..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>逆さまに戻されてた雑誌を手に取り、
#. ぺらぺらとページをめくっていくと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I picked up the inverted magazine and flipped through\n"
"it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. こ、これって…！？
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Th-This is...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>雑誌の中ほどのページに、
#. 唐突に書かれた大きな血文字…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>On one of the pages, near the center of the magazine,\n"
"a word had been written in bold, bloody letters...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>“フカワ”<CLT><CLT 4>と書かれた血文字…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And it said...<CLT><CLT 3>Toko<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって、ひょっとして…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Could this be...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …ダイイングメッセージ！？
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...a dying message!?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君も見つけたみたいね…
msgctxt "0041 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Then it would appear you've found it."
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さん…これって…
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Kyoko...is this...?"
msgstr ""

#. ダイイングメッセージ…でしょうね。
#. <CLT 3>人の指で書かれている<CLT>わ。
msgctxt "0043 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It is indeed a dying message. Someone <CLT 3>used their\n"
"finger to write it<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ダイイングメッセージ…
#. やっぱり、そうか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A dying message...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. だけど、その雑誌が上下逆さまになっていたのは、
#. 私のせいじゃないわよ。
msgctxt "0045 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But just to be clear, I'm not the one who put it back\n"
"upside down."
msgstr ""

#. さっき、私が見つけた時は、
#. すでにその状態になっていたわ。
msgctxt "0046 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It was already like that when I found it a little\n"
"while ago."
msgstr ""

#. 私は、その雑誌を調べた後、忠実に元に戻しただけ。
#. 後で捜査する人の為にね。
msgctxt "0047 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I made sure to put it back exactly as I found it, for\n"
"the benefit of others who might come looking."
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ…それって…
msgctxt "0048 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "H-Hey... Is that...?"
msgstr ""

#. フカワって…書いてあるよね…？
msgctxt "0049 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "That says...Toko, right?"
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…そうみたいだけど…
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-Yeah, it looks like it."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、犯人はあいつなんだね！？
#. そうなんだね！？
msgctxt "0051 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Then...she's the killer! Right!?"
msgstr ""

#. いや…まだ決まった訳じゃ…
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "W-Well, it hasn't been confirmed yet..."
msgstr ""

#. 決まってんじゃん！
#. あいつが犯人に決まってんじゃん！！
msgctxt "0053 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "It's settled! She's the killer for sure!"
msgstr ""

#. 決定的な証拠だよ！
#. これで犯人を追いつめられるよ！！
msgctxt "0054 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"That's conclusive evidence, right!? We can use it to\n"
"corner the killer!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>決定的な証拠…確かにそうかもしれないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can see why you would think that, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんか、あからさま過ぎて…
#. 逆の意味で怪しい気がするんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It just seems too easy. If anything, it makes me that\n"
"much more suspicious...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>雑誌のダイイングメッセージ<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Magazine Dying Message<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>１冊だけ逆さまに戻された雑誌…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A single magazine put back upside down...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、その雑誌の中ほどのページに、
#. 唐突に書かれた大きな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And on one of the pages, a word had been written in\n"
"blood.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>“フカワ”<CLT><CLT 4>と書かれた血文字…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And it said...<CLT><CLT 3>Toko<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって、ひょっとして…ダイイングメッセージ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is this really a dying message...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. その雑誌、さっき私が見つけた時は、
#. すでに逆さまになっていたわ。
msgctxt "0062 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "The magazine was already upside down when I found it."
msgstr ""

#. 私は、それを忠実に元に戻しただけ。
#. 後で捜査する人の為にね。
msgctxt "0063 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I was sure to put it back just like I found it, for\n"
"the benefit of anyone else who might be curious."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これ、決定的な証拠…かもしれないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You could certainly call this conclusive evidence,\n"
"but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんか、あからさま過ぎて…
#. 逆の意味で怪しい気がするんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0065 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It just seems too easy. If anything, it makes me that\n"
"much more suspicious...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは、オセロか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That same copy of Othello...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>事件には…関係ないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's not really related to the case, though.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ダーツ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That same dartboard...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>事件には…関係ないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's not really related to the case, though.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ビリヤードだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That same pool table...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>事件には…関係ないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's not really related to the case, though.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ロッカーのドアが開いてる…
#. しかもロッカーの内側には…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The locker's open. And there on the inside...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって、<CLT><CLT 3>手形<CLT><CLT 4>だよな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's...a <CLT><CLT 3>handprint<CLT><CLT 4>?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. どうして、そんな所に
#. 手形が残されているのかしらね？
msgctxt "0074 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "What's a handprint doing here?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>ロッカーの内側<CLT>にこびり付いた埃のせいで、
#. 触った部分に手形が残ったみたいだけど…
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It looks like someone touched <CLT 3>the inside of the\n"
"locker<CLT>, and it left a handprint in all the dust..."
msgstr ""

#. しかも、結構新しい手形のようね…
msgctxt "0076 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "And it looks quite fresh, too."
msgstr ""

#. きっと、誰かがロッカーの中に隠れて、
#. その際に手形を付けてしまったんでしょうね…
msgctxt "0077 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Most likely someone was hiding here in the locker, and\n"
"they left behind a little something extra..."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、犯人が密室が破られるまで、
#. この<CLT 3>ロッカーの中に隠れてた<CLT>可能性はないわ。
msgctxt "0078 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But there's <CLT 3>no way the killer was in there<CLT> when we\n"
"opened the door."
msgstr ""

#. 思い出してみて。密室を破る前、
#. 窓ガラス越しに娯楽室を覗いた時の事…
msgctxt "0079 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Think back. Before we opened the door, we looked\n"
"inside the room, right?"
msgstr ""

#. そっか…あの時すでに、
#. <CLT 3>ロッカーは開いてた<CLT>んだ…
msgctxt "0080 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Oh yeah... And the locker was <CLT 3>already open<CLT> at that\n"
"point..."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、密室が破られた後まで、
#. 誰かがここに隠れていた可能性はない。
msgctxt "0081 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"So it's impossible that someone could have hidden in\n"
"there until *after* we opened the door."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>うーん、だとしたら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0082 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yeah. So then...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このロッカーの手形の意味って…
#. なんなんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...what does this handprint mean?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ソファーだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0084 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The couch...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>気になる事は…特にないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0085 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't think it matters right now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このテーブルには…
#. 事件の手掛かりになるものはないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0086 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>On the table is...nothing that could be considered\n"
"helpful.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確か、モノクマボトルにも新しい発見があるって、
#. 霧切さんが言ってたっけ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0087 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I think Kyoko said she'd found a new clue involving\n"
"the Monokuma Bottles...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>新しい発見…新しい発見…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0088 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Something new...something new...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>うーん……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Hừm...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. …どう？　わかった？
msgctxt "0090 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So? Did you figure it out?"
msgstr ""

#. よく見ればわかるはずよ。
#. そのモノクマボトルに隠された<CLT 3>規則性<CLT>にね…
msgctxt "0091 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"There's a hidden <CLT 3>correlation<CLT> between all the\n"
"bottles. Pay careful attention and you're sure to find it."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>規則性ねぇ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0092 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A correlation...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>うーん……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0093 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Umm...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、霧切さん。
#. 教えてもらうってのは駄目なのかな？
msgctxt "0094 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hey, Kyoko...can't you just tell me what it is?"
msgstr ""

#. 手掛かりだけならまだしも、
#. そこから導き出す答えまで共有するのは危険だわ…
msgctxt "0095 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I don't mind guiding you toward clues, but giving you\n"
"my conclusion isn't a good idea."
msgstr ""

#. 学級裁判前に、余計な先入観を植え付けたくないの。
#. それぞれが納得した答えを出す為にね…
msgctxt "0096 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Each person needs to come to their own conclusions, so\n"
"that everyone can have confidence in the outcome."
msgstr ""

#. 信用してないから教えない…訳じゃないよね？
msgctxt "0097 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And it's not just because you don't trust me...right?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0098 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 無言なのッ！？
msgctxt "0099 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "No answer!?"
msgstr ""

#. ある程度は信用しているわよ。
#. でなきゃ、こんな事を言ったりしないわ。
msgctxt "0100 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I do trust you, to a degree. Otherwise, I wouldn't\n"
"have told you anything to begin with."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ある程度ねぇ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0101 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Only to a degree...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>手帳の<CLT><CLT 3>モノクマボトル<CLT><CLT 23>を更新しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0102 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Monokuma Bottle<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been updated in the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 実はね、そのモノクマボトルに関して、
#. <CLT 3>もう１つ気になる事<CLT>があるんだけど…
msgctxt "0103 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Actually, there's <CLT 3>one other thing<CLT> about the Monokuma\n"
"Bottles that's bothering me..."
msgstr ""

#. それを確かめる為の<CLT 3>“実験”<CLT>をしたいの。
#. 手伝ってもらえるわよね？
msgctxt "0104 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I'd like to do an <CLT 3>experiment<CLT> to confirm it. You\n"
"don't mind helping me, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 実験…？
msgctxt "0105 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "An experiment...?"
msgstr ""

#. まず床に散らばったモノクマボトルの破片を集めて。
#. 小さな破片も、なるべく残さないようにね…
msgctxt "0106 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Can you gather up all the pieces of the broken\n"
"Monokuma Bottle? Try to get the smaller pieces, too."
msgstr ""

#. え…？　でも大丈夫？
#. 勝手に現場の物をいじったりして…
msgctxt "0107 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Huh? Are you sure it's okay to mess with the crime\n"
"scene like that...?"
msgstr ""

#. 一通り調べ終わった後だし、問題ないはずよ。
#. うるさい十神君もいないしね…
msgctxt "0108 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I've already done a thorough investigation, so it's\n"
"fine. And that obnoxious Byakuya's not here, so..."
msgstr ""

#. 私は化学室に行って必要な道具を持ってくるから、
#. その間によろしく…
msgctxt "0109 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I need to get something from the chem lab.\n"
"While I'm gone, try to gather up all the glass."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言い残して、霧切さんは娯楽室を後にした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0110 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>With that, Kyoko left the room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 訳がわからないけど…
msgctxt "0111 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I really don't know what this is about, but..."
msgstr ""

#. 仕方がない…やるしかないか…
msgctxt "0112 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...what choice do I have? I'd better just do it."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>娯楽室のほうきとちりとりを使って、
#. 床に散らばったボトルの破片を集めていく…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0113 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I took the broom and dustpan and got to work\n"
"collecting all the broken bottle pieces.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、ちょうど破片を集め終わった頃…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0114 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And just as I finished up...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …お待たせ。
msgctxt "0115 | NO NAME"
msgid "Sorry to keep you waiting."
msgstr ""

#. 準備は出来てるわね？
#. さっそく始めましょうか…
msgctxt "0116 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Is everything ready? Then let's get to work."
msgstr ""

#. 実験って…何をするの？
msgctxt "0117 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So...what kind of experiment are we doing?"
msgstr ""

#. 化学室から天秤を持って来たわ。
#. これで重さを比べてみるのよ。
msgctxt "0118 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I got a scale from the chem lab. We're going to use it\n"
"to compare weights."
msgstr ""

#. 何と何の重さを…？
msgctxt "0119 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Compare the weights...of what?"
msgstr ""

#. あなたが集めた<CLT 3>破片<CLT>と、
#. 残った<CLT 3>モノクマボトルの重さ<CLT>よ。
msgctxt "0120 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The <CLT 3>pieces of glass<CLT> you collected, and one of the\n"
"<CLT 3>Monokuma Bottles<CLT> that's still intact."
msgstr ""

#. どうして、そんな事を…？
msgctxt "0121 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Why do you want to do that...?"
msgstr ""

#. やってみればわかるわ。
#. その為の実験なんだから…
msgctxt "0122 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"That's the point of the experiment. It'll make sense\n"
"when we're done."
msgstr ""

#. まず最初に、モノクマボトル同士の重さを
#. 比べておきましょうか。
msgctxt "0123 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"First, let's compare the weight of two of the normal\n"
"Monokuma Bottles."
msgstr ""

#. 天秤は釣り合ったままだね…
msgctxt "0124 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's...balanced."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、<CLT 3>モノクマボトルの重さは、
#. どれもほぼ同じ<CLT>って事になるわね。
msgctxt "0125 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Which means, <CLT 3>each Monokuma Bottle weighs about the\n"
"same<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. まぁ、当然だよね…
msgctxt "0126 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Which makes sense..."
msgstr ""

#. 中のモノクマフィギュアにもほとんど差がないし、
#. 他に、重さが変わりそうな要因もないしね。
msgctxt "0127 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The Monokuma figures inside are basically the same,\n"
"and nothing else could really affect the weight."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、本番はここからよ…
msgctxt "0128 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Now, here comes the important part..."
msgstr ""

#. 天秤の片方に、あなたが拾い集めたボトルの破片を
#. 乗せてみましょう。
msgctxt "0129 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Put all the pieces you picked up on one side of the\n"
"scale."
msgstr ""

#. どういう結果が出るかしらね…
msgctxt "0130 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Now, what might we expect to see?"
msgstr ""

#. 普通に考えたら…
msgctxt "0131 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Well, a normal assumption would be..."
msgstr ""

#. 重さが釣り合うか、集めた破片の方が軽いか、
#. そのどっちかだろうね。
msgctxt "0132 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"...either they'll balance out, or the pieces I\n"
"collected will be lighter."
msgstr ""

#. 頑張って破片を拾い集めはしたけど…
#. やっぱり、足りない可能性だってあるからね。
msgctxt "0133 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I did my best to get them all, but there's a chance I\n"
"could have missed some here and there."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、やってみましょう。
msgctxt "0134 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Okay, then let's give it a try."
msgstr ""

#. あれ…！？
msgctxt "0135 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. ボクが<CLT 3>集めた破片の方が重い<CLT>！？
msgctxt "0136 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The <CLT 3>broken pieces<CLT> are...heavier!?"
msgstr ""

#. そんな…どうして…！？
msgctxt "0137 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "H-How is that possible...?"
msgstr ""

#. …やっぱりそうだったのね。
msgctxt "0138 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Just as I thought..."
msgstr ""

#. …やっぱり？
msgctxt "0139 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

#. 今の<CLT 3>実験の結果<CLT>と<CLT 3>モノクマボトルの規則性<CLT>…
#. それらを併せて考えてみれば…
msgctxt "0140 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The <CLT 3>results of our experiment<CLT>, and the <CLT 3>correlation\n"
"between each of the bottles<CLT>—put it all together..."
msgstr ""

#. そこから導き出される答えは１つしかないように、
#. 私には思えるけど…
msgctxt "0141 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"...and I believe you will arrive at one very\n"
"persuasive conclusion."
msgstr ""

#. あなたはどう考える？　あなた次第よ。
msgctxt "0142 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So? What do you think? It's all on you."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>モノクマボトルの実験<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0143 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Monokuma Bottle Experiment<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the\n"
"Truth Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. うーん…
msgctxt "0144 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>新しい発見…新しい発見…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0145 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Something new...something new...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. よく見ればわかるはずよ。
#. モノクマボトルに隠された規則性にね…
msgctxt "0146 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"There's a hidden correlation between all the bottles.\n"
"Pay careful attention and you're sure to find it."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>規則性ねぇ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0147 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A correlation...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 規則性もわからないけど、
#. 実験の結果の意味も…わからないよ…
msgctxt "0148 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I don't know what the bottles have in common, and I\n"
"don't understand the results of the experiment..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクが集めた、床に散らばっていた破片と
#. 残ったモノクマボトルの重さを比べたら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0149 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Comparing the weight of the broken bottle pieces to a\n"
"completely intact Monokuma Bottle...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクが集めた破片の方が…<CLT><CLT 3>全然重かった<CLT><CLT 4>。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0150 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...the broken pieces were <CLT><CLT 3>clearly heavier<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どういう意味なんだろう？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0151 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What does that mean...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>実験の結果<CLT>と<CLT 3>モノクマボトルの規則性<CLT>…
#. それらを併せて考えてみれば…
msgctxt "0152 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The <CLT 3>results of our experiment<CLT>, and the <CLT 3>correlation\n"
"between each of the bottles<CLT>—put it all together..."
msgstr ""

#. そこから導き出される答えは１つしかないように、
#. 私には思えるけど…
msgctxt "0153 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"...and I believe you will arrive at one very\n"
"persuasive conclusion."
msgstr ""

#. あなたはどう考える？　あなた次第よ。
msgctxt "0154 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So? What do you think? It's all on you."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大神さんの死体にも…
#. 新しい手掛かりがあるって言ってたけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0155 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>According to Kyoko, there's still something to be\n"
"discovered from Sakura's body...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ぼんやり眺めてるだけじゃ、
#. 何もわからないわよ…
msgctxt "0156 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Just staring off into space isn't going to help you\n"
"figure anything out."
msgstr ""

#. そりゃ…そうかもしれないけど…
msgctxt "0157 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "W-Well, yeah, I know. But..."
msgstr ""

#. …死体には触らなくていいの？
msgctxt "0158 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Don't you think you might need to actually examine the\n"
"body?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0159 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …仕方がないわね。
msgctxt "0160 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "There's no getting around it."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>尻込みするボクとは正反対に、
#. 霧切さんは平然と死体に触れていく…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0161 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Unlike me, Kyoko didn't recoil at the thought of\n"
"touching a dead body. She was completely unemotional.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もはや見なれた光景…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0162 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the kind of thing I've grown perversely used\n"
"to...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど…改めて思う…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0163 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Although, there are still some times...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. よく顔色１つ変えずに死体を触れるね…
#. ボクなんか、いくら死体を見ても慣れないのに…
msgctxt "0164 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I can't believe how calm you are. No matter how many\n"
"times I see a dead body, I can't get used to it..."
msgstr ""

#. …そっちが普通よ。
msgctxt "0165 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's totally normal."
msgstr ""

#. だったら、どうして霧切さんは…
msgctxt "0166 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Then...how can you...?"
msgstr ""

#. それは…きっと私が…
#. 以前から死体と接する機会が…
msgctxt "0167 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I imagine it's because I've had plenty of\n"
"opportunities to touch dead bodies in the past."
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0168 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. …いえ、なんでもないわ。
msgctxt "0169 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Sorry, never mind."
msgstr ""

#. それより、これを見て。
msgctxt "0170 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "More importantly, look here..."
msgstr ""

#. 大神さんの<CLT 3>靴<CLT>…？
msgctxt "0171 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Her...<CLT 3>shoes<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. 足の甲に、<CLT 3>黄色い粉末<CLT>が付着しているでしょう？
msgctxt "0172 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "You see that <CLT 3>yellow powder<CLT> on her instep?"
msgstr ""

#. うん、確かに…
msgctxt "0173 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, it really stands out..."
msgstr ""

#. 大神さんの足の甲に付着した粉末…
#. これが１つめの手掛かりよ。
msgctxt "0174 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That powder is clue number one."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>足に付着した黄色い粉末<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0175 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Yellow Powder<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth Bullets\n"
"section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 次は、彼女の<CLT 3>頭部の傷痕<CLT>よ。
#. よく見て…
msgctxt "0176 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Next is the <CLT 3>wound to her head<CLT>. Look carefully..."
msgstr ""

#. …といっても、見るのはキツイでしょうから、
#. 説明してあげるわ。
msgctxt "0177 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Actually, even telling you that, it's incredibly\n"
"difficult to spot. So let me just explain..."
msgstr ""

#. 彼女の頭部の打撃痕は、
#. どうやら１つじゃないみたいなの…
msgctxt "0178 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It would appear that she didn't suffer a single\n"
"blow..."
msgstr ""

#. 彼女の<CLT 3>頭の傷は２つ<CLT>だったのよ…
msgctxt "0179 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...but instead, received <CLT 3>two blows to the head<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 打撃痕が２つ…？
msgctxt "0180 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Two blows...?"
msgstr ""

#. 興味深いでしょ…？
#. ついでに、興味深い事実をもう１つ…
msgctxt "0181 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Interesting, wouldn't you say? And there's one more\n"
"interesting thing..."
msgstr ""

#. 殺された彼女の<CLT 3>両手はキレイなまま<CLT>だったわ。
#. 指先に血痕すら付いていない状態だったのよ…
msgctxt "0182 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 3>Both of her hands were spotless<CLT>. There's absolutely\n"
"no trace of blood on either one."
msgstr ""

#. まぁ、大神さんの死体を調べて判明した事実は
#. こんなところね…
msgctxt "0183 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"So, that's what I learned from examining her body in\n"
"detail."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>死体を調べた霧切の証言<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0184 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Kyoko's Examination Summary<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the\n"
"Truth Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それにしても、死体を調べ上げて、
#. これだけの手掛かりを得るなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0185 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't believe she was able to learn all that just by\n"
"looking at her body...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さん以外には、
#. とても出来ない芸当だよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0186 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't think anyone but Kyoko could have pulled that\n"
"off.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 大神さんの死体の…新しい手掛かりは…
msgctxt "0187 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The new clues that Sakura's body revealed..."
msgstr ""

#. まず…大神さんの<CLT 3>靴<CLT>、その<CLT 3>足の甲<CLT>に、
#. <CLT 3>黄色い粉末<CLT>が付着している事…
msgctxt "0188 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"First was the <CLT 3>yellow powder<CLT> stuck to the <CLT 3>instep<CLT> of\n"
"her <CLT 3>shoe<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. それと、彼女の頭部の傷痕。
msgctxt "0189 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "And there's the wound on her head."
msgstr ""

#. 彼女の<CLT 3>頭部の打撃痕は、２つ<CLT>だったのよ…
msgctxt "0190 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It's now clear that she suffered <CLT 3>two blows to the\n"
"head<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. それから…
msgctxt "0191 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "And..."
msgstr ""

#. 殺された彼女の<CLT 3>両手はキレイなまま<CLT>だったわ。
#. 指先に血痕すら付いていない状態だったのよ…
msgctxt "0192 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 3>Both of her hands were spotless<CLT>. There's absolutely\n"
"no trace of blood on either one."
msgstr ""

#. まぁ、大神さんの死体を調べて判明した事実は
#. こんなところね…
msgctxt "0193 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"So, that's what I learned from examining her body in\n"
"detail."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それにしても、死体を調べ上げて、
#. これだけの手掛かりを得るなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0194 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't believe she was able to learn all that just by\n"
"looking at her body...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さん以外には、
#. とても出来ない芸当だよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0195 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't think anyone but Kyoko could have pulled that\n"
"off.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このイスがドアノブに突っかかってたせいで、
#. ドアが開かなくなってたんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0196 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The chair was shoved up against the doorknob, so we\n"
"couldn't get the door open.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、このイスには金具や糸のような仕掛けが
#. 取り付けられた形跡は見当たらない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0197 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no evidence that any kind of string or\n"
"mechanism was used on the chair...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、このイス自体に仕掛けがあったとは、
#. 考えられないって事か…
msgctxt "0198 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"In other words...there's no reason to think the chair\n"
"had anything special done to it."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>雑誌が収納されている棚の前に、
#. <CLT><CLT 3>血痕<CLT><CLT 4>が残されている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0199 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a <CLT><CLT 3>bloodstain<CLT><CLT 4> in front of the magazine\n"
"shelf...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大神さんが残した血痕だろうけど…
#. それにしては変だな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0200 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can only assume that the blood is Sakura's. But\n"
"that's strange if true...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうして、こんな…
#. 死体と離れた場所に？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0201 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Why is it so far away from where she died?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そのアメ…私があげたんだ…
msgctxt "0202 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I gave that to Sakura..."
msgstr ""

#. 私がジェノサイダーに怪我させられた時…
#. さくらちゃん…すっごく怒ってたでしょ？
msgctxt "0203 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"She got super upset when she found out Genocide Jack\n"
"had attacked me, right?"
msgstr ""

#. だから、少しでも落ち着いてもらおうと思って…
#. <CLT 3>保健室から出たすぐ後<CLT>に…あげたの…
msgctxt "0204 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"So <CLT 3>after we left the nurse's office<CLT>, I gave it to\n"
"her. I thought it might help her calm down a little..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大神さんが座ったイスの付近に、
#. <CLT><CLT 3>ガラスの破片<CLT><CLT 4>が散乱している。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0205 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are <CLT><CLT 3>shards of glass<CLT><CLT 4> scattered all around the\n"
"chair Sakura was sitting on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>赤いガラスの破片、しかも…
#. ボトルの飲み口の部分と底の部分だよな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0206 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The glass is all...red. And these are the top and\n"
"bottom sections of a bottle, right?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり、このガラスの破片は、
#. <CLT><CLT 3>元はボトルだった<CLT><CLT 4>って事か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0207 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So this must have originally been a <CLT><CLT 3>bottle<CLT><CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、そのガラス破片の傍には…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0208 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And on top of that, near the glass...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>手の平サイズの<CLT><CLT 3>モノクマのフィギュア<CLT><CLT 4>が
#. １つだけ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0209 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...it's a <CLT><CLT 3>Monokuma figure<CLT><CLT 4>, that fits in the palm of\n"
"my hand.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>娯楽室の入口付近に、
#. プラスチック製の容器が転がっている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0210 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's some kind of plastic container rolling around\n"
"near the entrance to the room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>プロテインの容器<CLT>みたいね。
#. しかも中身は空だわ。
msgctxt "0211 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "It looks like...a <CLT 3>protein drink<CLT>. And it's empty..."
msgstr ""

#. 大神さんが飲んだんだろうね…
#. よくプロテインを飲んでたもんね。
msgctxt "0212 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Sakura must have drank it. Everyone knows how much she\n"
"loved her protein..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それにしても、このプロテインの容器…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0213 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But still, this protein can...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>“化学室Ａ－２”<CLT><CLT 4>ってラベルが貼られている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0214 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's got a label on it that says <CLT><CLT 3>CHEM A-2<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…という事は、このプロテインって、
#. 化学室から持って来たんだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0215 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So she must have gotten this from the chem lab...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. でも、この容器の周りに散らばってるのって…
msgctxt "0216 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "But you see what's scattered around the can?"
msgstr ""

#. 薄水色のガラスの破片…
#. ボクが割ったドアの<CLT 3>窓ガラスの破片<CLT>だよね。
msgctxt "0217 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Shards of light blue glass... They must be parts of\n"
"the <CLT 3>window<CLT> I broke to get inside."
msgstr ""

#. この破片…容器の周りだけじゃなく、
#. <CLT 3>容器の下<CLT>にも散らばってるみたいよ…
msgctxt "0218 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But they aren't just scattered *around* the can.\n"
"They're also <CLT 3>underneath<CLT> it."
msgstr ""

#. それが…どうしたの？
msgctxt "0219 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Why does that matter...?"
msgstr ""

#. 詳しい事はまだわからないけど、
#. きっと覚えておいた方がいいわ。
msgctxt "0220 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I can't say for sure yet, but you're probably going to\n"
"want to take note of it."
msgstr ""

#. おそらく…とても重要な手掛かりになるはずよ…
msgctxt "0221 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I feel like it'll become an important clue later on..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>娯楽室のドア付近に、
#. 薄水色のガラスの破片が散らばっている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0222 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Shards of light blue glass are scattered across the\n"
"floor near the rec room door.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは娯楽室の<CLT><CLT 3>窓ガラスの破片<CLT><CLT 4>だな。
#. ボクが割った時に飛び散ったんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0223 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They're pieces of the <CLT><CLT 3>window<CLT><CLT 4> I had to break to get\n"
"into the room...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今の時刻は、<CLT><CLT 3>１３時付近<CLT><CLT 4>か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0224 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's around <CLT><CLT 3>1 o'clock<CLT><CLT 4> right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマファイルによると、
#. 大神さんが死亡したのが１２時頃だから…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0225 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>According to the Monokuma File, Sakura died around 12\n"
"noon.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大体、今から１時間近く前って事か。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0226 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So roughly an hour ago...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクと霧切さんとで、
#. アルターエゴを運んでいたくらいの時間帯かな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0227 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Was that when Kyoko and I were moving Alter Ego...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まだ、霧切さんに教えられたところを
#. 調べ終わってない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0228 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I haven't finished checking everything Kyoko told me\n"
"about...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0229 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0230 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0231 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>もう…そんな時間なのか…！
#. まだ密室トリックの謎も中途半端なままなのに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0232 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's already time...!? But the mystery of the\n"
"locked room is still only half solved...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この先は…
#. 学級裁判でなんとかするしかないって事か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0233 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>At this point, whatever happens will have to\n"
"happen at the class trial...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. いや…絶対になんとかしないと…ッ！
msgctxt "0234 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"No...not whatever happens. I have to\n"
"MAKE something happen!"
msgstr ""
